& [EvidenceVocabulary] is closed for this audit
  + [structural] means the strict closed machine form and validator represent and reject the requirement shape
  + [behavioral] means deterministic implementation plus focused positive and negative tests exercise the requirement
  + [integration] means multiple independently separated stages are replayed together under exact evidence
  + [verified] means supported only at the named grade and bounded experiment scope
  - never: convert verified into production, truth, safety, live-provider, persistence, external-effect, or hardware authority

