& [ReleaseResiduals] prevent scope drift
  + machine forms are the only procedure source accepted; textual Simula-inspired syntax remains absent
  + the Observer and validator principals are deterministic fixture identities, not production trust-service signatures
  + model-shaped authorship is supplied attribution and no model generation was called or proved
  + reconcile is the only executable cantor.exchange operation and the controller is fake and effectless
  + catalogue, archive, trace, and context exist only as in-memory values
  + no live provider, transport, service, persistence, external effect, native backend, WASM backend, FPGA, device, or production safety qualification exists
  + the inherited workspace README evidence mismatch remains a separate known fault

